         &nbsp;<br>127&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>FPUS53&nbsp;KAPX&nbsp;140012&nbsp;<br>ZFPAPX&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>Zone&nbsp;Forecast&nbsp;Product&nbsp;for&nbsp;Michigan&nbsp;<br>National&nbsp;Weather&nbsp;Service&nbsp;Gaylord&nbsp;MI&nbsp;<br>812&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ086-141200-&nbsp;<br>Western&nbsp;Chippewa-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;cities&nbsp;of&nbsp;Paradise,&nbsp;Trout&nbsp;Lake,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Rudyard&nbsp;<br>812&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Cloudy&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;20&nbsp;percent&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;<br>Patchy&nbsp;fog&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;night.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;<br>winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;25&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;<br>5&nbsp;to&nbsp;15&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;25&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;<br>30s.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;winds.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog&nbsp;early.&nbsp;A&nbsp;40&nbsp;percent&nbsp;chance&nbsp;<br>of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;<br>Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;<br>Light&nbsp;winds&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;west&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;<br>35&nbsp;mph&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Light&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Breezy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;50.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;20s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY...Partly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TUESDAY...Partly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>$$&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ087-141200-&nbsp;<br>Central&nbsp;Chippewa-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;cities&nbsp;of&nbsp;Sault&nbsp;Ste.&nbsp;Marie,&nbsp;Brimley,&nbsp;Kinross,&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>and&nbsp;Sugar&nbsp;Island&nbsp;<br>812&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Cloudy.&nbsp;Slight&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;early,&nbsp;<br>then&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;<br>lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;15&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;<br>25&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;showers&nbsp;40&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;<br>10&nbsp;to&nbsp;15&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy&nbsp;early&nbsp;then&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;partly&nbsp;<br>cloudy.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;North&nbsp;<br>winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;early&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;light.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog&nbsp;early.&nbsp;A&nbsp;30&nbsp;percent&nbsp;chance&nbsp;<br>of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;<br>Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;<br>30s.&nbsp;Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;shifting&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;with&nbsp;<br>gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Light&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Breezy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;50.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;30.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY...Partly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TUESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>$$&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ088-141200-&nbsp;<br>Southeast&nbsp;Chippewa-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;cities&nbsp;of&nbsp;Detour&nbsp;Village,&nbsp;Goetzville,&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>and&nbsp;Drummond&nbsp;Island&nbsp;<br>812&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Cloudy.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;<br>winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;<br>5&nbsp;to&nbsp;15&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;25&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;<br>30s.&nbsp;North&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph&nbsp;<br>shifting&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;northeast&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;<br>5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;<br>30s.&nbsp;Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;shifting&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;<br>to&nbsp;around&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Light&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Breezy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;30.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;40s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY...Partly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;60s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.MONDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.TUESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;around&nbsp;60.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>$$&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>MIZ095-141200-&nbsp;<br>Western&nbsp;Mackinac-&nbsp;<br>Including&nbsp;the&nbsp;cities&nbsp;of&nbsp;Engadine,&nbsp;Naubinway,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Epoufette&nbsp;<br>812&nbsp;PM&nbsp;EDT&nbsp;Tue&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;13&nbsp;2026&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>.TONIGHT...Cloudy&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;20&nbsp;percent&nbsp;chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;<br>Patchy&nbsp;fog&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;night.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;around&nbsp;40.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;up&nbsp;<br>to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;Northwest&nbsp;winds&nbsp;<br>5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;20&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.WEDNESDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;night.&nbsp;<br>Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;Light&nbsp;winds.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY...Mostly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog&nbsp;early.&nbsp;A&nbsp;50&nbsp;percent&nbsp;chance&nbsp;<br>of&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;afternoon.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;<br>Southeast&nbsp;winds&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.THURSDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Rain&nbsp;showers.&nbsp;Patchy&nbsp;fog.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;<br>Light&nbsp;winds&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;northwest&nbsp;5&nbsp;to&nbsp;10&nbsp;mph&nbsp;with&nbsp;gusts&nbsp;to&nbsp;around&nbsp;<br>30&nbsp;mph&nbsp;after&nbsp;midnight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY...Light&nbsp;rain&nbsp;showers&nbsp;likely.&nbsp;Breezy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;lower&nbsp;<br>50s.&nbsp;Chance&nbsp;of&nbsp;showers&nbsp;70&nbsp;percent.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.FRIDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Partly&nbsp;cloudy.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;upper&nbsp;20s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;50s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SATURDAY&nbsp;NIGHT...Mostly&nbsp;clear.&nbsp;Lows&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;mid&nbsp;30s.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>.SUNDAY...Mostly&nbsp;sunny.&nbsp;Breezy.&nbsp;Highs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the